{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 3 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলের প্রকৃতি -", "option1": "ক) বাস্তব ও সমান", "option2": "খ) মূলদ ও অসমান", "option3": "গ) অমূলদ ও অসমান", "option4": "ঘ) অবাস্তব ও সমান", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>নিশ্চায়ক = b<sup>2</sup> - 4ac = (-5)<sup>2</sup> + 4.2.(-3) = 25 + 24 = 7<sup>2</sup> যা পূর্ন বর্গ সংখ্যা<br />&there4; মূলদ্বয় মূলদ ও অসমান।</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) 3/x - 4/(x + 1) = 1 হলে x এর মান -", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 0", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>3/x - 4/(x + 1) = 1<br />বা, (3x + 3 - 4x)/x(x + 1) = 1<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + x = -x + 3<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 3 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 3x - x - 3 = 0<br />বা, x(x + 3) - 1(x + 3) = 0<br />বা, (x + 3)(x - 1) = 0<br />&there4; x = -3, 1</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a - [a - {a - (a - (a - 1))}] = ?", "option1": "ক) -a", "option2": "খ) a", "option3": "গ) a - 1", "option4": "ঘ) a + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a - [a - {a - (a - (a - 1))}] <br />= a - [a - {a - (a - a + 1)}] <br />= a - [a - {a - 1}] <br />= a - [a - a + 1] <br />= a - 1</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) ax<sup>3</sup> + ax + 10 = 0 এর একটি মূল 2 হলে a এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, সমীকরনটির একটি মূল ২<br />&there4; a(2)<sup>3</sup> + a.2 + 10 = 0<br />বা, 8a + 2a + 10 = 0<br />বা, 10a + 10 = 0<br />বা, a + 1 = 0<br />&there4; a = -1</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x এমন একটি সংখ্যা যার বর্গ তার 6 গুণ অপেক্ষা 5 বেশি। এই তথ্যটি গাণিতিক আকারে প্রকাশ করলে পাই -", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + 6x + 5 = 0", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 5 = 0", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + 6x - 5 = 0", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 5 = 0", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>সংখ্যাটি x,<br />শর্তমতে, x<sup>2</sup> = 6x + 5<br />&there4; x2 - 6x - 5 = 0</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) &radic;(x + 2) = &radic;x + &radic;2 হলে x = কত?", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) &radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x = 0 হলে,<br />বামপক্ষ = ডানপক্ষ = &radic;2<br />&there4; x = 0</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 3 = 0 সমীকরনের মূলদ্বয়ের অন্তর-", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>মূলদ্বয় a, b হলে a + b = 4, ab = 3<br />&there4; (a - b)<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)<sup>2</sup> - 4ab<br />= 16 - 4.3<br />= 4<br />&there4; a - b = &plusmn;2</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x &lt; 0 এবং 14x + x<sup>2</sup> = 0 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) -15", "option2": "খ) -14", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 14", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>14x + x<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> = -14x<br />&there4; x = -14</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x = 2y = 3z এবং xyz = 36 হলে, y = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 1/2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x = 2y = 3z<br />&there4; x = 2y এবং z = 2y/3<br />এখন,<br />xyz = 36<br />বা, 2y &times; y &times; 2y/3 = 36<br />বা, 4y<sup>3</sup> = 36 &times; 3<br />বা, y<sup>3</sup> = 27 = 3<sup>3</sup><br />&there4; y = 3</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x<sup>2</sup> - bx + 4 = 0 এর মূলদ্বয় সমান হলে ( b &gt; 0) b এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -4", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু মূলদ্বয় সমান<br />&there4; নিশ্চায়ক = ০<br />বা, (-b)<sup>2</sup>- 4.1.4 = 0<br />বা, b<sup>2</sup> -16 = 0<br />বা, b<sup>2</sup> = 16<br />&there4; b = 4</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) যদি y = 5x - 4 এবং 5x + 8 = 53 হলে y = ?", "option1": "ক) 39", "option2": "খ) 41", "option3": "গ) 43", "option4": "ঘ) 45", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>5x + 8 = 53<br />বা, 5x = 45<br />&there4; x = 9<br />আবার,<br />y = 5x - 4<br />= 5.9 - 4<br />= 45 - 4<br />= 41</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) x + 3y = 16 এবং x = 5y হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 5