: "18", "question": "১৮) x &gt; y এবং xy &lt; 0 হলে নিচের কোনটি অবশ্যই ধনাত্মক?", "option1": "ক) y - x", "option2": "খ) x - y", "option3": "গ) y", "option4": "ঘ) x/y", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু x &gt; y এবং xy &lt; 0<br />&there4; x &gt; 0 এবং y &lt; 0<br />&there4; x - y সর্বদা ধনাত্মক।</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) 0 &lt; x &lt; 1 হলে কোনটি অপর তিনটি অপেক্ষা বৃহত্তর হবে?", "option1": "ক) 1/x<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) 1/x<sup>3</sup>", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>3</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>যেহেতু, 0 &lt; x &lt; 1<br />ধরি, x = 1/5<br />&there4; 1/x = 5<br />&there4; 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 125 যা বৃহত্তর।</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) x > 0, y > 0 এবং 1/x < 1/y হলে কোনটি সত্য?", "option1": "ক) x - y < 0", "option2": "খ) y - x > 0", "option3": "গ) x - y > 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1/x - 1/y > 0", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x = 7, y = 2 হলে,<br />1/7 &lt; 1/2<br />বা, 1/x &lt; 1/y<br />বা, x &gt; y<br />&there4; x - y &gt; 0</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1200000, "pk": 2479, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2479}